        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Janitors</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op horror game where you and your friends clean haunted locations. What starts as a simple job quickly turns into a terrifying fight against eerie ghosts and dark secrets. Stay brave, work together, and scrub away the supernatural—<strong>if you dare</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DO YOUR JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up the house with your team, get out and get rewarded for each task you complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/d0d7f08a2a988210bdccbac6818ae232.poster.avif?t=1786649840\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/d0d7f08a2a988210bdccbac6818ae232.webm?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/d0d7f08a2a988210bdccbac6818ae232.mp4?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY IN THE LIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the generator and lights running, and <u><strong>stay in the light</strong></u>. Be careful not to turn on too many lights, or the generator will shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/00f629e9cc7f9cfcc44c77e29f8b301d.poster.avif?t=1786649840\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/00f629e9cc7f9cfcc44c77e29f8b301d.webm?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/00f629e9cc7f9cfcc44c77e29f8b301d.mp4?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANDOMIZED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough has a unique experience; Ghost Janitors introduces randomized ghosts, tasks, sounds, jumpscares, and more, delivering dynamic and <strong>unpredictable gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/824e8d32505834746997f3247208730e.poster.avif?t=1786649840\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/824e8d32505834746997f3247208730e.webm?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/824e8d32505834746997f3247208730e.mp4?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedication pays off, as the game rewards your progress with unlockable content. Discover <strong>5+ maps</strong> with captivating backstories, perks to enhance your gameplay and a range of cosmetics to personalize your character.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/6c3b15ec09b7a69731b54a47045fa5a6.poster.avif?t=1786649840\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/6c3b15ec09b7a69731b54a47045fa5a6.webm?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/6c3b15ec09b7a69731b54a47045fa5a6.mp4?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Janitors boasts <strong>impressive graphics</strong>, <strong>heart-stopping jumpscares</strong>, and <strong>immersive 3D audio</strong>, creating a truly chilling atmosphere. Engage in <strong>proximity voice chat</strong> to share the terror with your friends in real time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/f02ed59e64ffbb97b0702da2bde08ab9.poster.avif?t=1786649840\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/f02ed59e64ffbb97b0702da2bde08ab9.webm?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/f02ed59e64ffbb97b0702da2bde08ab9.mp4?t=1786649840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're seeking a horror game that combines thrills and entertainment, <strong>Ghost Janitors is a must-play</strong>. Gather your team, equip yourselves, and let's conquer the haunted challenge together!</p>",
